      "task": "Plan the CONTENT-LOOP module (row 12 in docs/plans/ARCHITECTURE.md: edited meshes, textures and volumes appear in the running game without a stall; needs APPLE-PRESENTATION M2). Write its design, milestones and done-when file so M1 is buildable as soon as APPLE-PRESENTATION M2 passes review. SEA, CLOUDS and RENDER-2D depend on it; account for what they will need from it.",
